          "line_number": 1,
          "location": "top right",
          "text": "January 2003"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 2,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "Dear Jeffrey,"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 3,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "The beginning of a new year is an appropriate time"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 4,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "to count our blessings."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 5,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "Among mine is your friendship. It's been more than"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 6,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "a decade since we met by chance at an airport in"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 7,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "Washington. During that time you've been a good friend."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 8,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "I'm grateful for that and for what I hope will be many"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 9,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "more years of your friendship."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 10,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "Among your blessings has been the opportunity"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 11,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "to lead a full, exciting, and fantastically varied"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 12,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "life. Now that you've reached a critical milestone,"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 13,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "I hope you will intensify your activities in the"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 14,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "widest possible range of issues, especially in the"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 15,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "field of science where you've already done so much."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 16,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "With my congratulations, gratitude and"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 17,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "best wishes,"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 18,
          "location": "right",
          "text": "George Mitchell"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 19,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "P.S. As you know, Heather shares your birthday,"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 20,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "confirming my belief that a lot of great people"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 21,
          "location": "left",
          "text": "were born on January 20 !"
        }
      ]
