      "lines": [
        {
          "line_number": 1,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "Your centered individuality, your lack"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 2,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "of desire for public recognition, reminds"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 3,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "me of a story I once heard about the"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 4,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "Irish playwright, Samuel Beckett - he spent"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 5,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "his life avoiding the public eye. None was a"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 6,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "greater sense of displeasure than recognition"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 7,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "from the teeming masses. So, the story goes"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 8,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "like this - Beckett was with his mistress"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 9,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "in Morocco and received a telegram from"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 10,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "Ireland with the news he had been awarded"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 11,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "the Nobel Prize. His reaction? \"This is the"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 12,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "worst news I have ever received.\""
        },
        {
          "line_number": 13,
          "location": "middle left",
          "text": "A word from the wise, to the wise, is sufficient."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 14,
          "location": "middle left",
          "text": "Jeffrey, I love you, as a brilliant and"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 15,
          "location": "middle left",
          "text": "unpredictable friend. May you always maintain"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 16,
          "location": "middle left",
          "text": "your inner solitude."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 17,
          "location": "middle left",
          "text": "I wish you health, stealth & continued wealth,"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 18,
          "location": "middle left",
          "text": "not necessarily in that order. Happy Birthday!"
        }
      ]
