      "lines": [
        {
          "line_number": 1,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "Dear Jeffrey,"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 2,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "On this occasion, I am reminded of your many"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 3,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "conversations, fuelled by both your curiosity and your"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 4,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "skepticism. Quoting great minds may be the only"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 5,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "gift I can give you to stimulate the one and release"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 6,
          "location": "top left",
          "text": "the other."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 7,
          "location": "left center",
          "text": "First, Oliver Wendell Holmes, Jr.:"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 8,
          "location": "left center",
          "text": "'Certitude is not the test of certainty. We have"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 9,
          "location": "left center",
          "text": "been cock sure of many things that were just so.' Your"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 10,
          "location": "left center",
          "text": "curiosity, continuing on with your skepticism, will"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 11,
          "location": "left center",
          "text": "take care of this without hazard, birthday after birthday."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 12,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "Next, Thoreau:"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 13,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "\"Pursue, keep up with, circle round and round"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 14,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "your life, as a dog does his master's chase. Do"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 15,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "what you love. Know your own bone; gnaw at"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 16,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "it, bury it, unearth it and gnaw it still.\" This"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 17,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "too, you do admirably."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 18,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "Then, Leonardo da Vinci:"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 19,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "\"Iron rusts from disuse, stagnant water loses its"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 20,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "purity and in cold weather becomes frozen; even so"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 21,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "does inaction sap the vigor of the mind.\" Epstein is"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 22,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "not at risk. When he is in the room, you do not"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 23,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "fall asleep."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 24,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "Finally, a remark from the not so great Gertrude Stein"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 25,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "on your interests:"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 26,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "\"As a cousin of mine once said about money,"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 27,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "money is always there but the pockets change; it is"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 28,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "not in the same pockets after a change, and that"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 29,
          "location": "center",
          "text": "is all there is to say about money.\""
        },
        {
          "line_number": 30,
          "location": "lower center",
          "text": "You have said more and, going beyond"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 31,
          "location": "lower center",
          "text": "talk, have shown how to find it."
        },
        {
          "line_number": 32,
          "location": "bottom left",
          "text": "And so, felicitations on the vigors of your"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 33,
          "location": "bottom left",
          "text": "body and mind, and warm hopes for many occasions"
        },
        {
          "line_number": 34,
          "location": "bottom left",
